reviewNotes:
The Substrate console is a client for Substrate, a personal server its user runs; the app does nothing without one. We run a demonstration server for review with no real user's data.

To sign in, open the app, enter {server} as the server, and sign in with the repository and password below on the server's page.

Repository: {user}
Password: {password}

Accounts live on the user's own server and are never created in the app. Privacy policy: {privacy}
